      "text": "**Definition**: A function k: X × X → ℝ is a positive definite (PD) kernel if:\n1. Symmetric: k(x, x') = k(x', x)\n2. Positive semidefinite: for any finite set {x₁,...,xₘ}, the Gram matrix K with Kᵢⱼ = k(xᵢ, xⱼ) is PSD"
    },
